== Miniaturization <sec:future_mini>

Let us address the elephant in the room first;
our artifact does not measure or represent any @LOD features.
The initial premise was to investigate the viability of these 
algorithms in a real-time environment, with the crux being that 
it should be scalable for large procedural worlds.
We tried to lay the groundwork for such research instead,
and believe @SC to be the best fit, at least algorithmically.

@NCA papers mention the possibility of scaling beyond individual cells, 
but we could not deduce how effective that would be in practice, and 
whether it could apply to vegetation or only subdivisible city-like structures.